Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 07:19:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Allow OAUTH2_PROVIDER options to be set via config.yaml /
 environment

Merge a dict from config key 'oauth2_provider' or the env variable
INVENTREE_OAUTH2_PROVIDER (JSON) into OAUTH2_PROVIDER, so deployments can
set django-oauth-toolkit options (DCR_ENABLED, CIMD_ENABLED, token
lifetimes, ALLOW_LOCALHOST_LOOPBACK, ...). Only the names of overridden
keys are logged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
